Implementation Details
Automatic Totals: The store and update methods automatically calculate subtotal, tax_amount, and grand_total based on line items and GST tax IDs.

Status Guards: The update method ensures only DRAFT status orders can be edited. The approve method converts DRAFT to OPEN.

RBAC: All endpoints are protected by check.module.permission:PO.
